# Legacy chat artifact assets (attached_assets from prior Antigravity sessions)
.conversation/

# System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.cursor/rules/nx-rules.mdc
.github/instructions/nx.instructions.md

# Replit
.cache/
.local/

